          "title": "最好的无损图像格式是什么？",
          "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202206/bg2022060802.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>作者比较了四种无损的图像格式，评论它们的表现：PNG、WebP、AVIF 和 JPEG XL。</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "最好的无损图像格式是什么？",
              "url": "https://siipo.la/blog/whats-the-best-lossless-image-format-comparing-png-webp-avif-and-jpeg-xl"
